{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Map every outcome the payment sheet can hand back to merchant-facing behavior."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"kind":"article","sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every entry point — "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"’s "},{"code":"presentCard(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"makeCardComponent(onResult:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCardComponent","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" directly — resolves to a single "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" with three terminal states:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/completed(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" — the payment succeeded; the associated ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" carries the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sessionToken"},{"text":" you reconcile against your backend.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" — the flow ended in a failure, carrying a ","type":"text"},{"code":"MollieError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","isActive":true},{"text":" — the cardholder dismissed the flow.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["switch result {","case .completed(let payment):","    \/\/ payment.sessionToken, payment.amount, payment.currency","case .failed(let error):","    \/\/ Inspect error and map to your own localized UI (see the table below)","case .cancelled:","    \/\/ Normal dismissal — not an error","}"]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Cancellation is not an error","anchor":"Cancellation-is-not-an-error"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"normal terminal state"}]},{"type":"text","text":", distinct from "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/failed(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". It fires when the cardholder dismisses the sheet, taps cancel, or the presenting context is torn down. Do not surface it as an error, log it as a failure, or retry automatically — treat it the way you would a user backing out of any modal. (The underlying "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"type":"text","text":" cancellation cases listed under "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"#Reserved","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are never delivered to you; cancellation always surfaces here.)"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"errorDescription"},{"text":" strings on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"text":" are developer- and log-facing copy. They are not localized for cardholders — map each case to your own UI strings using the table below. This is unaffected by the SDK’s own localization support: the cardholder-facing chrome the SDK renders itself (the card form and 3-D Secure screen) is localized and follows the ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"locale"},{"text":" you pass to ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieCheckout","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":"‘s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"init(clientToken:locale:beforeSubmit:)"},{"text":" (default: the device locale), but ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"text":" deliberately stays English so it’s safe as log\/support copy regardless of the cardholder’s locale.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"},{"level":2,"text":"Merchant-reachable cases","type":"heading","anchor":"Merchant-reachable-cases"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The table below covers every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"type":"text","text":" case the SDK can deliver in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".failed"},{"type":"text","text":". Case names are shown in code font; the live documentation for each (Option-click in Xcode) lives on the real "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError"},{"type":"text","text":" symbols in the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieCore"},{"type":"text","text":" module."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Case"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Meaning \/ Cause","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Recommended action"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".network(URLError)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Transport failure before any HTTP response (offline, DNS, TLS, URL-layer timeout). The SDK auto-retries transient transport failures for idempotent reads (GET\/PUT\/DELETE) only; charging POSTs (tokenisation, checkout-attempt creation) surface on the first failure with an indeterminate outcome."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Transient. Prompt “check your connection and try again”; inspect "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"URLError.code"},{"type":"text","text":" for specifics. Re-presenting starts a fresh attempt — for a charging operation, reconcile server-side first rather than blindly re-charging."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.unauthorized)"},{"type":"text","text":" (401)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The bearer "},{"code":"clientToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is missing, expired, or invalid."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Merchant fix: your backend mints a fresh session and hands the new token to the SDK. Not retryable with the same token."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.forbidden)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (403)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Authenticated but not permitted — wrong profile, payment method not enabled, or test\/live mode mismatch."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Configuration fix; refreshing the token won’t help. Verify the profile and mode. Contact support if entitlements look correct."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.notFound)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (404)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Resource missing: the session expired or never existed, or the base URL\/path is wrong."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Confirm the token is current and the "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MollieEndpoints","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" are correct; otherwise create a new session."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.validationFailed([Violation]))"},{"type":"text","text":" (422)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"RFC 7807 field violations — usually bad card input (often rewrapped as "},{"code":".tokenizationFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Map each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Violation.name"},{"type":"text","text":" to a form field and show its "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"type":"text","text":" inline. Cardholder-retryable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".api(.conflict(retryAfter:))"},{"type":"text","text":" (409)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A competing or duplicate operation on the session."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK auto-retries idempotent ops only, honouring "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"retryAfter"},{"type":"text","text":" when present; a charging POST surfaces immediately (no auto-retry). On a charging operation, reconcile or create a new session rather than re-charging blindly."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.rateLimited(retryAfter:))","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (429)","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The request was throttled.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The SDK auto-retries idempotent ops only, honouring ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"retryAfter"},{"text":" (falling back to jittered exponential backoff); a charging POST surfaces immediately. Don’t hard-fail to the cardholder on a 429 from a read — the SDK is already backing off. If it surfaces from a charge, review your call cadence before re-presenting.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".api(.serverError(Int))","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An unexpected HTTP status (the wrapped "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":", e.g. 500\/502\/503)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A 5xx is server-classified transient: the SDK auto-retries it with jittered backoff for idempotent ops only. A charging POST is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"never"}]},{"type":"text","text":" auto-retried on 5xx — the outcome is indeterminate, so it surfaces for server-side reconciliation before any re-charge. An unexpected 4xx is likely an integration issue — contact support with the status code."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidClientToken(reason:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"code":"clientToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not valid base64 or its JSON failed to parse."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Integration error: forward the exact ","type":"text"},{"code":"client_access_token","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" verbatim — no re-encoding or truncation — and confirm it was not already consumed. Not retryable.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".timeout(operation:)","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The polling budget was exhausted, an attempt got stuck, or no terminal event arrived ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"operation"},{"type":"text","text":" is one of session-polling, checkout-attempt-polling, checkout-attempt-stuck, card-payment). Outcome is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"indeterminate","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reconcile server-side before re-presenting — do not silently re-charge. Surface “we’re confirming your payment”. The polling budget ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"pollingTimeoutSeconds"},{"type":"text","text":") is configurable."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".sessionFailed(ProblemDetails?)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A backend terminal failure, or the SDK rejected an unsafe 3DS challenge or redirect URL ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"title: \"invalid_configuration\""},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"detail: \"Unsafe 3DS challenge URL\""},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"Unsafe redirect URL\""},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A genuine decline → read "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ProblemDetails.detail"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".title"},{"type":"text","text":" and suggest another card. For the “Unsafe … URL” variants → a security\/configuration signal; contact support with the session token (the cardholder cannot fix this)."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".tokenizationFailed(reason:underlying:)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Card-to-token conversion failed during tokenisation — a validation rewrap, or another error in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"underlying"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Usually a mistyped card: show "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"type":"text","text":" and prompt re-entry. If "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"underlying"},{"type":"text","text":" is a network or server error, the tokenisation POST is "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" auto-retried (it is a charging op with no server-honoured dedup) and the outcome may be indeterminate — a re-attempt should follow server-side reconciliation rather than a blind re-charge. ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"type":"text","text":" is safe to display — the SDK never logs PAN or CVC.)"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".threeDSFailed(reason:)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"3D Secure did not succeed. See the "},{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" cases below."}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Depends on the reason — see the next table."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".invalidConfiguration(field:reason:)"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Misuse or an unsupported host state, split by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"field"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardNumber"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"expiry"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cardholderName"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cvc"},{"text":" are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"cardholder-correctable","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (show ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"text":" inline). ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"host"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"scene"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sheet"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"submit"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"checkoutAttemptToken"},{"text":" are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"integration bugs"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (present from a VC in a window, not while another modal is up; require an active foreground scene; no double-submit). ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"validator\/parser disagreement\""},{"text":" is an SDK bug.","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Fix the integration for the host-state fields; show ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reason"},{"text":" inline for the card-field ones. Report the “validator\/parser disagreement” variant to Mollie.","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":".unknown(Error)","type":"codeVoice"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Unclassified catch-all — in practice where uncaught ","type":"text"},{"code":"DecodingError","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"s land.","type":"text"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Allow one retry. If it persists, capture the wrapped description plus request context and contact support. Engineering should monitor "},{"code":".unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" rates (spikes ≈ contract drift)."}]}]]],"type":"table","header":"row"},{"level":3,"text":"3D Secure failures","type":"heading","anchor":"3D-Secure-failures"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When ","type":"text"},{"code":".threeDSFailed(reason:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is delivered, the associated ","type":"text"},{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" narrows the cause:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"header":"row","type":"table","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Reason","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Meaning \/ Cause"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Recommended action"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".challengeFailed","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The bank rejected authentication — wrong OTP, the banking app wasn’t approved, or the cardholder cancelled the challenge."}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Cardholder-retryable, or suggest another card."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".sdkError(message:)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A WebView or ACS technical failure (","type":"text"},{"code":"navigation_error_<code>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"Unsafe navigation blocked\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"timeout\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"3DS error <code>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"mollie_error_<code>","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Mostly transient → retry. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\"Unsafe navigation blocked\""},{"text":" is a security signal — contact support. Do not show the raw ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"message"},{"text":"; map it to a generic “couldn’t complete authentication”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"anchor":"Reserved","type":"heading","text":"Reserved","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following cases are ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"declared but never currently emitted"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" by the SDK. They exist on the types for forward-compatibility. You do ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" need to write dead ","type":"text"},{"code":"catch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"switch","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" arms for them — handling the merchant-reachable cases above plus a ","type":"text"},{"code":"default","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is sufficient:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"MollieError.sessionExpired","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — session expiry surfaces as ","type":"text"},{"code":".api(.notFound)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or ","type":"text"},{"code":".timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", not this case.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError.sessionCancelled"},{"type":"text","text":" — cancellation surfaces as "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError.userCancelled"},{"type":"text","text":" — cancellation surfaces as "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MollieError.decoding(DecodingError)"},{"type":"text","text":" — decode failures currently fall through to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".unknown"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason.timeout","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — the 3DS timeout path currently uses "},{"code":".sdkError(\"timeout\")","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ThreeDSFailureReason.unknown","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — no current code path constructs it."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"These are reserved as documentation only — there is no associated API change. A future SDK release may begin emitting some of them; until then, treat them as unreachable."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note"},{"anchor":"Supporting-payload-types","type":"heading","text":"Supporting payload types","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Three supporting types carry the detail you map into merchant UI:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"ProblemDetails","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — the RFC 7807 body on ","type":"text"},{"code":".sessionFailed","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Inspect ","type":"text"},{"code":"type","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"title","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"detail","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"status","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"instance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and ","type":"text"},{"code":"extensions","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". The SDK synthesizes ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"invalid_configuration\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (with the “Unsafe … URL” detail) for the URL-safety rejections, and falls back to ","type":"text"},{"code":"\"unknown\"","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" when the server body can’t be parsed.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"Violation","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" — one per field error inside ","type":"text"},{"code":".api(.validationFailed)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". ","type":"text"},{"code":"name","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" identifies the offending form field; ","type":"text"},{"code":"reason","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is display-ready copy you can show inline.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"code":".tokenizationFailed.underlying","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" — inspect this wrapped error to tell a validation failure (cardholder mistyped) apart from a network or server failure. Tokenisation is a charging POST, so the SDK does not auto-retry it; on a network\/server failure the outcome may be indeterminate, and any re-attempt should follow server-side reconciliation rather than a blind re-charge.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/handlingerrors"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Handling Errors","modules":[{"name":"MollieComponents"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents"]]},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/HandlingErrors"},"references":{"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MolliePaymentResult/cancelled":{"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliepaymentresult\/cancelled","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePaymentResult\/cancelled","fragments":[{"text":"case","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"cancelled","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"MolliePaymentResult.cancelled","role":"symbol","type":"topic"},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MolliePayment":{"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliepayment","type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/build.MollieComponents\/documentation\/MollieComponents\/MolliePayment","title":"MolliePayment","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MolliePayment","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MolliePayment","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A successfully completed Mollie payment as surfaced to the merchant.","type":"text"}]},"doc://build.MollieComponents/documentation/MollieComponents/MolliePaymentResult":{"url":"\/documentation\/molliecomponents\/molliepaymentresult","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Terminal outcome of the callback-style entry points —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"MollieCheckout.presentCard(from:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"code":"MollieCardComponent","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"onResult","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" callback."}],"title":"MolliePaymentResult","type"